cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these methods, please cite them as below."
title: "Working with Sources: methods for coding historical sources into research databases"
abstract: >-
  Coding manuals, data models, code lists, quality-control procedures and test
  scenarios for building source-critical research databases from historical
  sources. The first project documents the coding of the General (Rumiantsev)
  Description of Little Russia, 1765-1769, for the town of Poltava. Methodology
  only: no source transcriptions and no coded data are included.
authors:
